msgstr "महिना"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:226
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "स्वचालित"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:232
msgid "Center on Start"
msgstr "सुरुआतमा केन्द्रित हुनुहोस्"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:234
msgid "Centers the Gantt chart on the start time and day of this event."
msgstr "सुरुआतमा र यो घटनाको दिनमा गान्ट चार्ट केन्द्रित गर्छ ।"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:239
msgid "Zoom to Fit"
msgstr "मिलाउन जुम गर्नुहोस्"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:241
msgid ""
"Zooms the Gantt chart so that you can see the entire duration of the event "
"on it."
msgstr "गान्ट चार्ट जूम गर्छ त्यसैले तपाईँले यसमा घटनाको पूरै अवधि हेर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:248
msgid "Pick Date"
msgstr "मिति लिनुहोस्"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:250
msgid "Moves the event to a date and time when all the attendees are free."
